# Option chain

The option chain endpoint provides the latest trade, latest quote, and greeks for each contract symbol of the underlying symbol.


# OpenAPI definition

```json
{
  "components": {
    "headers": {
      "ratelimit_limit": {
        "description": "Request limit per minute.",
        "example": 100,
        "schema": {
          "type": "integer"
        }
